# Full generated matrix fixtures are not committed; CI provisions that matrix
# from the pinned VeraCrypt console. The small hash_sha512.hc golden fixture is
# checked in and is used by the adapter integration test.
*.hc
!hash_sha512.hc

# hash_sha512.hc was created by VeraCrypt console 1.26.29 (Debian 12 amd64),
# package SHA-256 62405d1a0c958995ace30267b0007537e3b0b8efee32b424262a752127d5218c,
# using AES/SHA-512/PIM 0/FAT and password "veracrypt interop fixture password".
# Its MARKER.TXT is "interop fixture hash_sha512 AES sha-512" plus newline.
